而且你动作也很快。

906
00:30:37.540 --> 00:30:37.940
That's right.
没错。

907
00:30:38.000 --> 00:30:38.420
She's very faSt.
她非常快。

908
00:30:38.900 --> 00:30:45.940
Michael's seen with Dwight when he calls Dwight into his office and he tells Dwight that he has to fire someone.
迈克尔把德怀特叫进办公室，告诉他必须解雇一个人，这一幕被德怀特看到了。

