926
00:31:22.960 --> 00:31:24.020
That is a funny scene.
那场戏真好笑。

927
00:31:24.200 --> 00:31:24.400
Well,
嗯，

928
00:31:24.440 --> 00:31:37.580
Paul Feig called in when we did Office Olympics and he said one of the things he loved about directing episodes of our shows is that you could really find a shot that was cool and you would have the support of Greg to just kind of go with it.
保罗·费格在我们拍《办公室奥运会》时打来电话，他说他喜欢执导我们剧集的原因之一，就是你可以真正找到一个很酷的镜头，而且格雷格会支持你大胆尝试。

